# GMI Cloud API key — https://console.gmicloud.ai → API Keys.
# Used by `npm run enrich` (paper summaries + graphics) and by /api/summarize
# (on-demand summaries for the live feed). If unset, the script also looks in
# ~/.config/gmi/.env, where the `gmi` CLI stores it.
GMI_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides
# ATLAS_LLM_MODEL=deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash
# ATLAS_IMAGE_MODEL=seedream-4-0-250828

# Optional: Semantic Scholar API key for `npm run discover` (unauthenticated calls are throttled)
# S2_API_KEY=
